<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 74.8900 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 74.8900 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 74.8900 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.3998 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Apr 15		  Apr 14</p>
<p> High			     75.2000		 75.5900</p>
